Package: TrajectoryMarkovAnalysis
Type: Package
Title: Estimate and Simulate Discrete Patient Trajectories
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: person("Markus", "Haug", email = "markus.haug@ut.ee",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0935-3307"))
Description: Estimates transitions and recorded healthcare costs from patient
    trajectories, including histories created by 'Cohort2Trajectory'. Supports
    follow-up periods, time-varying covariates, explicitly ordered transition
    stages, deterministic cohort projection and patient simulation. Cost records
    can be supplied locally or extracted through 'CDMConnector'. Explicit
    intervention, reward and mortality assumptions support economic scenarios.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
